OL,3,GNEWSAConstable painting draws crowds in
OL,4,Ahis home county
OL,5,
OL,6,FA famous John Constable painting has
OL,7,Fbeen viewed by more than 11,000 people
OL,8,Fsince it went on display in the county
OL,9,Fit depicts for the first time.
OL,11,FThe Hay Wain, an 1821 oil painting of a
OL,12,Frural scene near the River Stour in
OL,13,FFlatford, Suffolk, was unveiled at
OL,14,FIpswich's Christchurch Mansion two
OL,15,Fmonths ago.
OL,17,FIt will remain there until 4 October,
OL,18,Fhaving been loaned to Colchester and
OL,19,FIpswich Museums from the National
OL,20,FGallery in London.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
